Central Stats Service Pattern:

Architecture:
- Single authoritative StatsService running in AI OS
- All components query this service for token counts
- Service maintains real-time counters with atomic operations
- Provides read-only access to prevent inconsistencies

NovaLang StatsService Design:

```novolang
service StatsService {
    private totalTokens: AtomicLong = 0
    private sessionTokens: Map[SessionID, Long] = {}

    method incrementTokens(sessionID: SessionID, count: Long) {
        atomic {
            totalTokens += count
            sessionTokens[sessionID] += count
        }
    }

    method getSessionTokens(sessionID: SessionID): Long {
        return sessionTokens.getOrDefault(sessionID, 0)
    }

    method getTotalTokens(): Long {
        return totalTokens.get()
    }
}
```

Integration Points:
- Cloud Router: Calls incrementTokens on each request
- Hivemind: Queries session totals before processing
- Dashboard: Pulls real-time stats from StatsService
- Session Manager: Resets session counters when needed

Benefits:
- Single source of truth eliminates drift
- Atomic operations ensure consistency
- Centralized logic reduces bugs
- Easy to audit and debug
- Scales with proper concurrency controls
